      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bispebjerg"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Bispebjerg Cemetery opened in 1903, followed by the hospital built between 1908 and 1913, both shaping the district’s identity.",
